## Presentation Rehearsal

Our team discussed the project through **Discord** and reviewed our presentation plan. During my rehearsal, I focused on speaking clearly, explaining my assigned section, and making sure I could finish within the allocated time.

While practising, I checked the following:

- Audio quality and microphone.
- Screen sharing and slide visibility.
- Speaking speed and pronunciation.
- Timing for each section of the presentation.
- Smooth transitions between slides.

I realised that I was speaking slightly too quickly during my first practice. After rehearsing again, I slowed down my speaking pace and felt more confident explaining the project.

