This week's activities showed me that practical learning is the most effective way for me to improve my programming skills. Conducting a simple learning experiment helped me understand how I learn best, while presentation rehearsal increased my confidence in explaining technical work.

Working with my teammates through Discord also improved our communication and helped us organise our project more effectively. I feel better prepared for both the project presentation and future programming tasks.

